# armour/shared/pauldron_leaf3_l: the medium LEAF pauldron on the left shoulder (leaf.3; FORGE-SHOULDERS, STYLE_P2 28.3).
# two leaf lames hanging from the shoulder, each pointed at its foot, the lower one lapping out a pixel (the DROP
# mass's leaf shape: Sylvan leaf plate, TIDE and LEAF roots). Each leaf a lit half over a shaded half and a centre vein.
# Rides the lean and the bob and lifts a pixel on wind-ups (`up`). Finish regions: R the leaves' edges, N the veins, P the upper leaf's face.
# Shared by the man and the woman (D10). Generated by FORGE-SHOULDERS gen.py from shapes.py (re-run, never hand-edit
# the derived views). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
role pauldron leaf.3
layer armNear
anchor shoulderL
keys pauld
z 5
side L

